<!DOCTYPE html>

<html dir="rtl" lang="ar">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/>
<title>الإصلاح الكيماوي للخرسانة</title>
<style>
:root{
  --navy:#163d52;
  --gold:#b58a57;
  --text:#18384a;
  --muted:#6c7a84;
  --bg:#eef2f4;
  --line:#dbe3e8;
  --card:#ffffff;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);font-family:Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;color:var(--text)}
.phone{max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;min-height:100vh;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.top{padding:16px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
.brand{font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
.menu{font-size:24px;color:var(--navy)}
.hero{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:28px 22px 26px}
.eyebrow{font-size:11px;color:#dfc08f;letter-spacing:.4px;margin-bottom:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:right}
h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:31px;line-height:1.28}
h2{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45}
.hero p{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:2.0;color:#eef4f7}
.section{padding:26px 18px 0}
.section h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;color:var(--text)}
.section p.desc{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
.card img{display:block;width:100%;height:155px;object-fit:cover;background:#f0f3f5}
.card .cap{padding:10px 10px 12px;text-align:center}
.card .cap strong{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.55}
.call{padding:22px 18px 28px}
.cta{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:18px;padding:24px 18px;text-align:center}
.cta h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}
.cta p{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:#eef4f7}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:var(--navy);padding:12px 22px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
.note{padding:0 18px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#75838d;line-height:1.8}

.card img{object-fit:cover;object-position:center;height:170px}.grid{align-items:stretch}.card .cap{min-height:45px}</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="phone">
<div class="top">
<div class="menu">☰</div>
<div class="brand">لمسات الإبداع للمقاولات</div>
